<title>AUSTRIA: AMS Q1 pretax loss 8.5 mln ATS.</title>
<headline>AMS Q1 pretax loss 8.5 mln ATS.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian microchip maker AMS on Tuesday posted a pretax loss of 8.5 million schillings in the first quarter of 1997, compared with a pretax profit of 38.2 million in the year ago period.</p>
<p>The company said order backlog came to 572.3 million schillings against 869.9 million in the first quarter of 1996.</p>
